00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:30,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've reduced ourselves to
being thieves</font>

135
00:08:30,400 --> 00:08:33,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we're a somewhat
famous Shinobi clan around here!</font>

136
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:38,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Instead of taking your life
I could hire you if you want!</font>

137
00:08:39,370 --> 00:08:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja, huh...</font>

138
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I don't need to go easy on you.</font>

139
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be acting like a big shot, old man!</font>

140
00:08:49,960 --> 00:08:51,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up you squirt!</font>

141
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:56,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Ninja refers to one who endures.</font>

142
00:08:57,470 --> 00:08:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those who couldn't endure
their hunger pangs</font>

143
00:08:58,850 --> 00:09:02,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and resort to use their diligently
studied Jutsu for stealing</font>

144
00:09:02,680 --> 00:09:04,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">are not called Ninja!</font>

145
00:09:05,060 --> 00:09:06,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let that pass!</font>

146
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking we're fellow Shinobi
we took pity on you.</font>

147
00:09:10,230 --> 00:09:11,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Acting all conceited!</font>

148
00:09:12,900 --> 00:09:15,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Regret after being sliced in two!</font>

149
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:23,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fuma Ninja Blade Zanbato!</font>

150
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

151
00:09:44,310 --> 00:09:46,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You punk! How dare you
do that to the boss!</font>

152
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:48,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't let you do
any more than that!</font>

153
00:09:48,600 --> 00:09:49,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh?</font>

154
00:09:49,520 --> 00:09:51,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it you guys!</font>

155
00:10:04,500 --> 00:10:06,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't know you were so good!</font>

156
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:08,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu just now...</font>

157
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:11,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I sense you must be
a person of stature!</font>

158
00:10:12,130 --> 00:10:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it's all right
may I ask you your name?</font>

159
00:10:19,050 --> 00:10:21,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't know then I shall tell you!</font>

160
00:10:25,020 --> 00:10:28,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Women become infatuated
with his sex appeal.</font>

161
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's strong against Shinobi
but has a soft spot for women!</font>

162
00:10:30,810 --> 00:10:33,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He exists in Village Hidden in the Leaves...</font>

163
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:36,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And made his name known...</font>

164
00:10:44,740 --> 00:10:50,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master Jiraiya that's me!</font>

165
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

166
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys bow your heads
and beg for your lives!</font>

167
00:10:58,220 --> 00:11:00,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll all be killed!</font>

168
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Yes sir!
— Yes sir!</font>

169
00:11:05,010 --> 00:11:08,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Although we didn't know
being so rude to Master Jiraiya</font>

170
00:11:08,430 --> 00:11:12,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">reputed as one of the Legendary
Sannin of the Leaf Village!</font>

171
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:15,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We beg for your forgiveness!</font>

172
00:11:17,690 --> 00:11:20,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So my name's known in this land too...</font>

173
00:11:20,650 --> 00:11:22,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, it's okay.</font>

174
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:27,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So is it true that you know about
Village Hidden in the Sound?</font>

175
00:11:28,290 --> 00:11:32,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes! There were many Ninja clans
in the Land of Rice Paddies</font>

176
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">including us Fuma.</font>

177
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:37,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We divided up the roles
amongst ourselves</font>

178
00:11:37,250 --> 00:11:41,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the Ninja of this land
were doing well in their own way.</font>

179
00:11:42,300 --> 00:11:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Until that man appeared...</font>

180
00:11:46,810 --> 00:11:48,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who was that man?</font>

181
00:11:49,180 --> 00:11:51,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's regrettable to even speak
of that name...</font>

182
00:11:54,150 --> 00:11:56,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was Orochimaru!</font>

183
00:12:11,870 --> 00:12:13,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's okay! Rest easy!</font>

184
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:17,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If germs get into the wound
and you get tetanus</font>

185
00:12:17,710 --> 00:12:18,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you won't be saved.</font>

186
00:12:19,670 --> 00:12:23,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But fortunately I have medicine
so let me treat you.</font>

187
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:26,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're not coming.</font>

188
00:12:26,510 --> 00:12:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just show us your wound.</font>

189
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, huh?</font>

190
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, go wait outside
till my treatment is done.</font>

191
00:12:42,070 --> 00:12:42,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

192
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:52,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do I have to be
the only one chased out?!</font>

193
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez!</font>

194
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:58,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess it can't be helped.</font>

195
00:13:05,300 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't peek!</font>

196
00:13:15,770 --> 00:13:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know.</font>

197
00:13:17,310 --> 00:13:19,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, show me your wound.</font>

198
00:13:41,550 --> 00:13:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How mean...</font>

199
00:13:42,630 --> 00:13:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To hit me out of the blue...?</font>

200
00:13:49,090 --> 00:13:51,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whoa, interesting.</font>

201
00:13:51,890 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! You can come in!</font>

202
00:13:54,430 --> 00:13:56,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

203
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:03,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A cute girl?</font>

204
00:14:07,150 --> 00:14:09,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! This girl!
Who the heck is this girl?!</font>

205
00:14:10,030 --> 00:14:12,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How dense. It's the Ninja
from a moment ago.</font>

206
00:14:20,420 --> 00:14:21,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it...</font>

207
00:14:25,130 --> 00:14:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why...?</font>

208
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am Sasame Fuma.</font>

209
00:14:41,360 --> 00:14:45,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame... Why were you being
chased by those guys?</font>

210
00:14:45,860 --> 00:14:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you like try talking about it.</font>

211
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:50,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We might be able to help.</font>

212
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:01,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They were the Sound Ninja protecting
Orochimaru's residence.</font>

213
00:15:01,960 --> 00:15:02,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

214
00:15:03,250 --> 00:15:07,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry for mistaking you guys as
one of them the other day.</font>

215
00:15:08,010 --> 00:15:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That doesn't matter!</font>

216
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:12,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're also looking for Orochimaru!</font>

217
00:15:13,390 --> 00:15:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Would you please give us the details?</font>

218
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay...</font>

219
00:15:19,020 --> 00:15:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It all started with the Feudal Lord
of the Land of Rice Paddies</font>

220
00:15:22,980 --> 00:15:25,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">launching an attack on
a neighbouring land</font>

221
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:26,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in an attempt to expand the territory.</font>

222
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:30,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Rice Paddies is a small land...</font>

223
00:15:31,030 --> 00:15:33,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And there aren't that many Shinobi.</font>

224
00:15:35,450 --> 00:15:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was a foolhardy attack.
Losing was expected...</font>

225
00:15:40,540 --> 00:15:42,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the Shinobi clans of this land</font>

226
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:47,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who participated in
the losing battle went to ruin...</font>

227
00:15:48,760 --> 00:15:51,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We the Fuma Clan as well.</font>

228
00:15:53,510 --> 00:15:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hear that among
the surviving Shinobi</font>

229
00:15:55,470 --> 00:15:56,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are those who have left the land</font>

230
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:59,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and those who have
stooped to become thieves.</font>

231
00:15:59,850 --> 00:16:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even so we've lived believing
in a restoration of the clan</font>

232
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:05,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and continued to live hiding
in the shadows.</font>

233
00:16:06,770 --> 00:16:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time an emissary of Village Hidden
in the Sound appeared before us</font>

234
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">attempting to create the first full-scale
Shinobi village in the Land of Rice Paddies.</font>

235
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:21,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The emissary of
the Sound Village said...</font>

236
00:16:22,250 --> 00:16:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My master Orochimaru is
gathering all sorts of Jutsu!</font>

237
00:16:27,840 --> 00:16:30,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He has taken an interest
in your Jutsu well.</font>

238
00:16:31,380 --> 00:16:33,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Depending on your work</font>

239
00:16:33,090 --> 00:16:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you might be given the chance
to serve the Feudal Lord!</font>

240
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:39,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My cousin Arashi...</font>

241
00:16:40,180 --> 00:16:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">was an up-and-coming star
for the restoration of the clan...</font>

242
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:46,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Arashi as a representative of the clan</font>

243
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:49,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">headed for Village Hidden in
the Sound together with the emissary.</font>

244
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

245
00:16:55,610 --> 00:16:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And then...?</font>

246
00:16:58,240 --> 00:17:02,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We waited for a notice from Arashi but...</font>

247
00:17:03,790 --> 00:17:05,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no word from him, huh?</font>

248
00:17:10,050 --> 00:17:13,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!
He was tricked by that Orochimaru!</font>

249
00:17:13,590 --> 00:17:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

250
00:17:17,550 --> 00:17:18,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...!</font>

251
00:17:19,100 --> 00:17:23,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh, even so your cousin Arashi
might be safe...</font>

252
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:26,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We don't know, right?
And so... and so...</font>

253
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot...!</font>

254
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:30,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm going to save Arashi!</font>

255
00:17:31,530 --> 00:17:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have a small body and
my power is weak.</font>

256
00:17:35,650 --> 00:17:36,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So no matter what I did...</font>

257
00:17:37,070 --> 00:17:39,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did nothing but become a hindrance
even in Ninjutsu training...</font>

258
00:17:39,950 --> 00:17:43,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Arashi always saved me!</font>

259
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:47,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everyone in the village has
already given up but...</font>

260
00:17:48,210 --> 00:17:51,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I'll find Village Hidden
in the Sound alone...</font>

261
00:17:53,050 --> 00:17:55,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And so you were chased by
the Sound Ninja, right?</font>

262
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:59,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time it's my turn to save Arashi!</font>

263
00:18:00,890 --> 00:18:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasame!</font>

264
00:18:04,140 --> 00:18:07,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... I want to be of help to Arashi!</font>

265
00:18:09,150 --> 00:18:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

266
00:18:10,810 --> 00:18:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah... I know!</font>

267
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:18,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We have to go to Village of the Sound
to bring back Sasuke anyway so!</font>

268
00:18:19,450 --> 00:18:20,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now instead of one</font>

269
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:23,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's just that there are two guys
for us to bring back.</font>

270
00:18:27,580 --> 00:18:31,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll save your cousin, Sasame!</font>

271
00:18:33,710 --> 00:18:34,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

272
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Eew! A spider...</font>

273
00:18:43,850 --> 00:18:44,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?!</font>

274
00:18:50,100 --> 00:18:51,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

275
00:18:51,150 --> 00:18:53,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...! What's this?!</font>

276
00:18:56,860 --> 00:18:58,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Wind Spiders!</font>

277
00:19:00,610 --> 00:19:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My cute children made a path
for me out of silver thread</font>

278
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:09,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and told me where you guys
were going.</font>

279
00:19:11,380 --> 00:19:17,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All three of you together will descend
into hell while bearing the secret!</font>

280
00:19:23,140 --> 00:19:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! It's the Ventriloquism Jutsu!</font>

281
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's scattering his voice
to multiple directions</font>

282
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and covering up location and number!</font>

283
00:19:29,690 --> 00:19:32,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I get it! I leave this girl to you, Sakura!</font>

284
00:19:35,770 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

285
00:19:48,160 --> 00:19:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Bring it on from anywhere!</font>

286
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a large number
but it's just Clone Jutsu.</font>

287
00:19:56,630 --> 00:19:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No. Look closely, Jigumo!</font>

288
00:19:59,130 --> 00:20:00,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The threads are getting tangled.</font>

289
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:06,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All of the clones are tangible?!
Shadow clones?!</font>

290
00:20:06,970 --> 00:20:09,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so... Kagero!</font>

291
00:20:09,850 --> 00:20:11,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Understood...</font>

292
00:20:12,560 --> 00:20:14,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out!</font>

293
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:22,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Borne to be born, lived to live,
one sunrise and one sunset...</font>

294
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:25,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The life of a mayfly lasts but one day.</font>

295
00:20:25,620 --> 00:20:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thinking that such a fleeting life
is pitiable is in fact pitiable...</font>

296
00:20:30,950 --> 00:20:32,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Know that I'm at my best</font>

297
00:20:32,620 --> 00:20:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when living in the dark and
deep in the ground!</font>

298
00:20:40,420 --> 00:20:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art:</font>

299
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,840
